;ProScalper preset: Strategy Tester OPTIMIZER (many passes).
;Auto-starts like the unattended preset, but logging is OFF - per-bar Prints
;across thousands of passes would be slow and produce huge logs.
;After loading, tick the "optimize" checkbox on whichever input(s) you actually
;want to sweep (e.g. the InpStair*Pct fields) and set their start/step/stop in
;the Tester's Inputs tab - this file only fixes the operational flags, it does
;not pre-select what to optimize.
InpGap2PullbackWaitSeconds=30
InpGap2PullbackPoints=30
InpGap2StartMatchPoints=100
InpScalpPullbackWaitSeconds=30
InpScalpPullbackPoints=30
InpAbsoluteGapPriceLevel=1000.0
InpProSTargetOffset=30.0
InpStaircaseEnabled=true
InpStairP1TPPct=3.0
InpStairStage1SLPct=2.5
InpStairStage1TPPct=6.0
InpStairStage2SLPct=5.0
InpStairStage2TPPct=9.0
InpSRLookbackBars=200
InpSRFractalWidth=2
InpAutoStartForBacktest=true
InpAutoStartGapDollars=25.0
InpAutoStartGapLot=0.01
InpAutoStartGapProfitTrig=15.0
InpAutoStartGapLockAmount=6.0
InpAutoStartProtectMoney=15.0
InpAutoStartLockMoney=6.0
InpVerboseLog=false
